# Instrument routing (summary)

Use the **instrument-router** skill (`skills/instrument-router/SKILL.md`) for full routing tables.

- US equities/options/index options → **Alpaca-trading** first
- Crypto / Coinbase futures → **Coinbase**
- Forex, bonds, CME futures, NDX/RUT options → **ib-lean-bridge** + LEAN/IB
- Kalshi / Polymarket → **prediction-markets** MCP (this plugin)
- Preview before live orders; PM trading requires explicit user confirmation

